       *> RISKRATI - record layout of RiskRatingHistory (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY RISKRATI REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 701 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(190).
       *> Loan (relationship, string)
           15 :P:-LOAN-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-LOAN PIC X(64).
       *> ChangedByUser (relationship, string)
           15 :P:-CHANGED-BY-USER-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-CHANGED-BY-USER PIC X(64).
       *> EffectiveDate (raw, string)
           15 :P:-EFFECTIVE-DATE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-EFFECTIVE-DATE PIC X(64).
       *> PriorGrade (raw, int)
           15 :P:-PRIOR-GRADE-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-PRIOR-GRADE PIC S9(9) COMP-3.
       *> NewGrade (raw, int)
           15 :P:-NEW-GRADE PIC S9(9) COMP-3.
       *> Reason (raw, string)
           15 :P:-REASON-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-REASON PIC X(146).
       *> LoanLabel (lookup, string)
           15 :P:-LOAN-LABEL-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-LOAN-LABEL-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-LOAN-LABEL PIC X(64).
       *> ChangedByUserLabel (lookup, string)
           15 :P:-CHANGED-BY-USER-LABEL-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-CHANGED-BY-USER-LABEL-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-CHANGED-BY-USER-LABEL PIC X(64).
       *> GradeDelta (calculated, int)
           15 :P:-GRADE-DELTA-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-GRADE-DELTA PIC S9(18) COMP-3.
       *> IsDowngrade (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-DOWNGRADE-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-DOWNGRADE PIC X.
       *> IsInitialRating (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-INITIAL-RATING-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-INITIAL-RATING PIC X.
       *> CrossedClassifiedThreshold (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-CROSSED-CLASSIFIED-THR-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-CROSSED-CLASSIFIED-THR PIC X.
